'''Shakurel Panda''' is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Shakurel Planet Collaboration Event]] and the [[Catclaw Dojo]]. It was added in [[Version 8.8 Update|Version 8.8]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Shakurel Panda
|image = E 475.png
|appearance = [[Shakurel Planet Collaboration Event]]<br>
[[Arena of Honor/Attack of the Shakurels|Attack of the Shakurels]]
|money drop = 900¢ - 3,555¢
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy has high health, low attack power and range, but has a fast attack rate as well as a 50% chance to [[Knockback|knockback]] Cat Units.

==Strategy==
To defeat him bring along some powerful [[Long Distance]] attackers to deal with his support, when alone Shakurel Panda is not too much of a threat but can be a bit of a threat for early-game players.

